00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:52.140
Do you know what a figure of speech is?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:56.980
Figures of speech are an element of the language
that is very common in music.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:04:00.800
Check out this quick explanation that
we gave in another one of our videos.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:27.240
